WEBVTT

01:36.429 --> 01:38.097
Come in.

01:42.519 --> 01:46.064
So this is what those stone
castles are like on the inside.

01:46.648 --> 01:48.983
The power and water are set up.

01:49.067 --> 01:51.319
Someone will come
to turn on the gas later.

01:52.028 --> 01:54.906
Dera-san, you can use
that Western-style room.

01:55.907 --> 01:58.201
Yuru-kun, you'd prefer a room
with tatami, right?

01:58.284 --> 01:59.160
Tatami?!

01:59.661 --> 02:03.081
Wow, actual tatami!

02:03.164 --> 02:07.627
At the village, tatami are
only used by Asa or for special events!

02:07.710 --> 02:09.504
Don't they use goza mats?

02:11.256 --> 02:14.717
The tatami down here are so thick.

02:14.801 --> 02:16.469
What luxury.

02:17.095 --> 02:19.347
Are you sure I can sleep here?

02:25.603 --> 02:28.064
Oh, sorry. Let me introduce you.

02:29.149 --> 02:31.192
This is Kotetsu, and this is Jiro.

02:32.902 --> 02:33.862
Excuse the intrusion.

02:36.948 --> 02:39.909
We're the Daemons of this boy
you'll be lookin' after.

02:39.993 --> 02:41.578
We're called the Divine Right and Left.

02:42.162 --> 02:43.621
I'm Right.

02:44.122 --> 02:47.250
And I'm Left. Nice to meet you.

02:50.253 --> 02:52.005
Are those Hana-chan's Daemons?

02:52.755 --> 02:54.090
Never met them before.

02:54.674 --> 02:57.510
These are Daemons? This dog and cat?

03:00.513 --> 03:02.849
They're not like other dogs and cats.

03:02.932 --> 03:04.225
They'll be lookin' after us.

03:04.309 --> 03:06.185
Give them a proper greeting.

03:06.895 --> 03:09.814
These are my Daemons, Zenko-Koro.

03:09.898 --> 03:11.691
ZENKO-KORO
TIGER AT THE FRONT DOOR, WOLF AT THE BACK

03:12.275 --> 03:13.359
Say hello.

03:13.443 --> 03:16.279
Hello... there...

03:18.323 --> 03:19.198
Danno?

03:19.282 --> 03:21.868
Since they know Dera-san's family name,

03:21.951 --> 03:24.120
we should use mine, right?

03:24.203 --> 03:26.581
Yeah, thanks. Sorry about that.

03:26.664 --> 03:28.625
Make sure you use this name, too.

03:29.459 --> 03:32.754
You both have family names?

03:32.837 --> 03:34.839
Are you from great families?

03:34.923 --> 03:37.592
Down here, everyone has one.

03:37.675 --> 03:39.802
By the way, Hana-chan's
got her own mountain.

03:39.886 --> 03:41.054
She's a land baron?!

03:41.137 --> 03:43.514
I just inherited it!

03:44.098 --> 03:49.020
No one maintains it, so it's overgrown,
but it's not like I can sell it.

03:49.103 --> 03:50.521
Can I go hunting there?

03:50.605 --> 03:52.607
Don't act like you're just
picking wild vegetables.

03:53.191 --> 03:55.526
Down here, you need a license to hunt.

03:55.610 --> 03:56.486
A license?

03:56.986 --> 03:58.154
Proof of permission.

03:58.238 --> 04:01.574
You need a license to drive
those metal horses, too.

04:01.658 --> 04:04.077
Everything down here is a pain...

04:30.853 --> 04:31.854
Hup.

04:35.817 --> 04:38.111
It's not working the way I want.

04:38.987 --> 04:41.114
Hard at work?

04:41.197 --> 04:42.282
Master.

04:43.533 --> 04:44.367
Hey.

04:47.161 --> 04:49.664
Sorry I keep damaging your yard.

04:49.747 --> 04:51.541
My accuracy still needs work.

04:51.624 --> 04:55.545
It's fine as long as
you don't kill anyone.

04:55.628 --> 04:57.505
Keep practicing.

04:57.588 --> 04:59.299
Jin, clean that up.

04:59.882 --> 05:02.093
Yes, sir. Ai-chan.

05:12.729 --> 05:14.397
What can I do for all of you?

05:15.857 --> 05:17.817
We're here to see Gabby-chan.

05:18.443 --> 05:21.571
Aw, you didn't have to come see me.

05:22.196 --> 05:23.740
How are you feeling?

05:23.823 --> 05:25.992
Pretty good, thankfully.

05:26.576 --> 05:28.661
And you, Gabriel?

05:30.204 --> 05:31.914
I see.

05:32.540 --> 05:34.500
Want an apple, Gabby-chan?

05:34.584 --> 05:35.418
Yeah.

05:35.501 --> 05:39.005
Oh, I forgot to bring a knife.

05:39.630 --> 05:40.757
Makoto-kun.

05:44.052 --> 05:44.927
Here you are.

05:45.428 --> 05:46.679
Thank you.

05:47.346 --> 05:52.310
You expect me to eat an apple cut with
a knife that came from who knows where?

05:52.894 --> 05:56.105
It's all right. I believe it
hasn't been used to stab anyone.

05:56.189 --> 05:58.357
Seriously, Jin-chan...

06:03.863 --> 06:06.365
Gabby-chan, you focus on recovering.

06:06.449 --> 06:08.117
Okay.

06:08.201 --> 06:11.120
- Asa, stay with her at the mansion.
- What?

06:12.038 --> 06:16.501
If word spreads that you and your brother
have left the mountain,

06:16.584 --> 06:19.128
people will come looking for you.

06:19.712 --> 06:24.717
There are even people within the Kagemori
clan who want you for themselves.

06:24.801 --> 06:27.053
You'll be safe here.

06:27.887 --> 06:31.015
Jin will look for Yuru-kun. Got it?

06:31.891 --> 06:33.017
Yes, sir.

06:33.726 --> 06:37.146
Actually, I don't even know
what your brother looks like.

06:37.814 --> 06:40.358
Aw, man. I should've taken a photo.

06:43.027 --> 06:44.654
- He looks like this!
- Biased.

06:45.154 --> 06:46.739
- Like this!
- Those art skills...

06:47.448 --> 06:48.324
Those art skills?!

06:49.700 --> 06:52.036
I'll start by looking into Tadera.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.412
I'm counting on you.

06:56.666 --> 06:58.000
Jin-san!

07:00.128 --> 07:01.379
What is it?

07:02.004 --> 07:04.257
My brother's Daemons have keen noses.

07:04.757 --> 07:07.385
Keen enough to identify people
by the smell of their blood.

07:11.806 --> 07:13.099
Those art skills...

07:15.476 --> 07:17.395
Hoo boy.

07:17.478 --> 07:19.564
I feel refreshed.

07:21.607 --> 07:23.484
Huh? Your facial hair...

07:24.235 --> 07:26.237
They saw my face, so I shaved it.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.614
I need to do everything
I can to disguise myself.

07:28.698 --> 07:31.242
You lost the only thing that
made you look like Statham.

07:31.325 --> 07:32.827
Now you're worthless.

07:33.536 --> 07:37.081
Just married, and my wife's
already emotionally abusing me.

07:42.086 --> 07:44.046
Where'd our son go?

07:44.130 --> 07:46.382
Yuru-kun went for a walk.

07:46.466 --> 07:47.675
He said he'd check out the area.

07:47.758 --> 07:49.760
Will he be okay?

07:49.844 --> 07:51.179
Left and Right are with him.

07:51.262 --> 07:53.014
I'm sure he'll be fine.

07:53.931 --> 07:56.726
Hana-chan, have you seen my machete?

07:56.809 --> 07:58.644
I haven't touched it.

07:58.728 --> 08:01.022
I left it by the door.

08:01.856 --> 08:05.401
I wonder how far he went.

08:08.070 --> 08:09.572
If the cops find him,

08:09.655 --> 08:12.742
we're looking at a Firearms
and Swords Control Act violation.

08:12.825 --> 08:16.412
I told that brat to stay out of trouble!

08:20.708 --> 08:22.752
The world below is amazing.

08:23.586 --> 08:25.713
The starry sky reaches the ground.

08:26.422 --> 08:27.882
It's so big and open.

08:27.965 --> 08:34.764
Feel like it's impossible to find
one person in this vast world?

08:35.473 --> 08:39.685
If she's looking for us,
you'll run into her eventually.

08:41.103 --> 08:43.356
Because you love each other? That's great.

08:47.735 --> 08:51.280
You can sense other Daemons, right?

08:52.114 --> 08:54.575
- You sensed Oshirasama.
- Yes.

08:55.785 --> 08:58.871
You know the smell
of the self-proclaimed Asa's blood, right?

08:58.955 --> 08:59.789
Yeah.

09:01.123 --> 09:06.295
Dera-san said the Kagemoris
have multiple Daemon Wielders.

09:06.963 --> 09:11.676
We're looking for a place with lots
of Daemons and that smells like my blood.

09:13.886 --> 09:15.680
We could do that.

09:15.763 --> 09:16.597
All right.

09:25.523 --> 09:27.984
Time to take the sensitivity up a notch!

10:03.436 --> 10:08.566
I smell blood like yours
and a handful of Daemons.

10:08.649 --> 10:11.027
There are Daemons nearby?

10:11.736 --> 10:15.156
If they show up, can we beat
them down, no questions asked?

10:15.781 --> 10:19.493
What if they're open to talking,
like Oshirasama?

10:20.411 --> 10:24.498
I wouldn't measure all Daemons
by human standards.

10:24.582 --> 10:26.876
In general, we live in different worlds.

10:26.959 --> 10:29.003
Don't expect to fully
understand each other.

10:29.879 --> 10:33.424
I see. So I should think
of them as bears or boars.

10:33.924 --> 10:35.051
Not exactly.

10:57.031 --> 10:57.990
Tadera's?

10:58.991 --> 11:00.076
Yes, that's right.

11:00.159 --> 11:02.662
They may have already fled.

11:03.537 --> 11:07.249
Yes, let me know if you learn anything.

11:08.459 --> 11:13.214
Yeah, they reek of Daemons and Asa.

11:14.256 --> 11:20.096
Since we've noticed them,
their Daemons should've noticed us, too.

11:20.179 --> 11:21.305
Do you see them?

11:21.389 --> 11:22.681
No, nothing.

11:23.557 --> 11:26.268
Those people in black are humans... right?

11:26.352 --> 11:27.937
They sure are.

11:44.328 --> 11:45.496
Asa!

11:45.579 --> 11:47.415
Wait, Yuru! That smells like old blood!

11:48.040 --> 11:48.874
That's...

12:01.971 --> 12:05.724
I heard your Daemons have keen noses.

12:06.767 --> 12:10.729
And since you reacted to this Asa-san,

12:11.480 --> 12:14.483
you must be her twin brother.

12:15.234 --> 12:18.487
Nice to meet you. I'm Kagemori Jin.

12:19.196 --> 12:22.408
These are my Daemons, the Scavenger.

12:23.325 --> 12:26.370
It's a pleasure to meet you, Yuru-san.

12:31.500 --> 12:33.669
Shit, shit, shit!

12:34.295 --> 12:36.630
We need to find Yuru-kun
right away, Senpai.

12:36.714 --> 12:40.342
Yeah. He doesn't know the rules,

12:40.426 --> 12:42.845
so he could end up hurting
someone down here.

12:43.345 --> 12:47.475
There's that, too,
but what if he gets hurt?

12:48.601 --> 12:53.647
You're being pretty nice for someone
who said she doesn't like kids.

12:53.731 --> 12:57.151
- What?! Don't be stupid!
- What?

12:57.234 --> 13:00.154
He doesn't have a family register yet.

13:00.738 --> 13:02.573
Well, yeah.

13:02.656 --> 13:05.367
He just came off the mountain.

13:06.744 --> 13:08.162
Which means...

13:10.206 --> 13:11.749
He doesn't have health insurance,

13:11.832 --> 13:14.210
so we have to cover 100%
of his medical bills!

13:14.710 --> 13:15.878
- Shit, shit, shit!
- Jiro.

13:17.838 --> 13:20.758
This is Yuru-kun's scent. Track him down.

13:25.346 --> 13:26.430
I'm counting on you.

13:33.354 --> 13:35.272
Kotetsu, you're up.

13:40.402 --> 13:43.489
Kotetsu and Jiro can use modern tech, huh?

13:43.572 --> 13:45.699
They've been passed down for generations

13:45.783 --> 13:49.245
and lived here for so long
that they've adapted.

13:49.328 --> 13:52.915
Now, where's Jiro?

13:53.582 --> 13:56.252
Yikes! He's all the way in Tokyo!

13:57.044 --> 13:59.046
He's not wasting any time.

13:59.129 --> 14:01.006
It must've been the Divine Right and Left.

14:01.549 --> 14:03.968
Is he lost? No...

14:04.760 --> 14:07.179
Does he have some specific purpose?

14:10.975 --> 14:16.355
Higashi Village wants both twins, too.

14:16.855 --> 14:22.403
However, we just attacked their
village, and you're on the run.

14:22.486 --> 14:25.364
Surely they wouldn't come for Asa-san now.

14:25.447 --> 14:29.660
But I couldn't rule out
that they'd expect us

14:29.743 --> 14:31.579
to let our guard down and strike.

14:32.288 --> 14:35.124
So I prepared for that possibility.

14:35.207 --> 14:37.209
You saved us the trouble
of looking for you.

14:38.669 --> 14:41.255
Thank you, Mr. Big Brother.

14:46.260 --> 14:47.136
So hard.

14:47.803 --> 14:49.763
Daemons, you're hiding, right?

14:50.389 --> 14:51.724
Come on out.

14:54.935 --> 14:55.769
What should we do?

14:55.853 --> 14:58.856
I don't smell metal on them.

14:58.939 --> 15:01.233
They don't have weapons.

15:01.734 --> 15:03.777
But I sense Daemons.

15:04.486 --> 15:06.363
Two more pairs besides that one.

15:06.447 --> 15:08.908
Probably their Daemons.

15:08.991 --> 15:12.786
They're hiding and waiting
to see what we do.

15:22.630 --> 15:23.631
Oh, well.

15:24.757 --> 15:26.800
Whatever happens, happens.

15:26.884 --> 15:28.135
There they are.

15:28.802 --> 15:30.346
Hold it right there.

15:30.429 --> 15:32.431
We've got your master.

15:33.349 --> 15:35.893
If you want him to live, then...

15:38.228 --> 15:40.981
S-Stop! Hey!

15:41.065 --> 15:43.275
Stop! Hey, wait!

15:43.901 --> 15:45.694
We've taken your master hostage!

15:45.778 --> 15:47.988
Who should we take hostage?

15:48.072 --> 15:51.241
Him. The sullen one.

15:51.325 --> 15:53.077
Hey, wait! I said stop!

15:55.329 --> 15:58.374
Sorry, Right and Left. I lost my temper.

15:58.457 --> 16:01.001
Eh, I don't blame you.

16:01.710 --> 16:03.545
Stay where you are.

16:03.629 --> 16:04.880
Why?

16:04.964 --> 16:10.177
By staying there, you're locking down
that troublesome-looking Daemon.

16:10.260 --> 16:13.472
Oh, right. Got it.

16:14.056 --> 16:17.309
Why is that Daemon giving
its master orders?

16:17.393 --> 16:21.021
Normally, Daemons prioritize
protecting their master!

16:21.105 --> 16:23.190
I'm hands off.

16:25.109 --> 16:26.944
We do things our own way.

16:29.029 --> 16:32.408
They're unarmed. Go easy on them, Right.

16:32.491 --> 16:35.452
Right back at you, Left.

16:36.036 --> 16:37.287
Makoto-kun.

16:41.500 --> 16:42.626
Right and Left, watch out!

16:50.509 --> 16:51.343
Huh?

16:51.844 --> 16:53.929
Watch out for what?

16:54.471 --> 16:56.765
We're made of stone.

16:58.100 --> 16:59.351
Of course.

17:05.274 --> 17:08.485
What are these annoyin' things?

17:08.569 --> 17:10.362
Some kind of matchlock firearms?

17:17.995 --> 17:19.705
That won't work on us.

17:23.876 --> 17:25.210
A stone lantern?

17:39.933 --> 17:41.560
They're armed to the teeth.

17:41.643 --> 17:43.395
Don't gotta hold back now.

17:43.479 --> 17:44.354
Agreed.

17:45.439 --> 17:47.149
This looks bad. Move, Akio!

17:47.232 --> 17:48.400
Here it comes!

17:52.362 --> 17:53.363
Left!

18:09.129 --> 18:10.839
What is this?

18:10.923 --> 18:12.382
Give me a hand, Left!

18:13.801 --> 18:15.719
Sorry, Right.

18:18.097 --> 18:19.306
I can't move.

18:20.390 --> 18:23.018
It's heavy. So, so heavy.

18:25.479 --> 18:26.313
What?!

18:27.648 --> 18:29.608
Help me, Left!

18:29.691 --> 18:32.027
Help yourself.

18:44.456 --> 18:45.457
That's it.

18:55.217 --> 18:56.635
Move, Yuru.

19:03.267 --> 19:04.810
Not as tough as those other teeth.

19:09.022 --> 19:10.274
Right!

19:10.357 --> 19:11.900
When you use the latrine,
before you leave...

19:14.820 --> 19:16.280
Extinguish the lights!

19:27.416 --> 19:30.085
- Haruo, where are you?
- Here.

19:31.086 --> 19:34.089
I sense the boy's Daemons
moving away from us.

19:34.173 --> 19:35.924
They got away?

19:36.008 --> 19:38.927
No, Akio's Daemons are lying in wait.

19:39.428 --> 19:42.848
Don't think you've gotten
away from us, Mr. Big—

19:43.515 --> 19:46.310
He's got the mind of a hunter.

19:54.067 --> 19:55.152
Makoto-kun!

20:11.251 --> 20:13.170
Did you get him?

20:13.253 --> 20:17.591
Hey! What kind of Daemons
abandon their master and run?

20:17.674 --> 20:18.634
What?

20:19.218 --> 20:23.472
I don't know about you guys,
but this is how we operate.

20:24.097 --> 20:26.516
We can do as we please as
long as we get the job done.

20:26.600 --> 20:30.771
What? Isn't it normal to run when you can?

20:30.854 --> 20:32.397
I don't want all of us to get wiped out.

20:32.481 --> 20:34.524
I suppose not.

20:35.192 --> 20:39.780
I'm sure you know, but Yuru
is the twin of the night.

20:40.364 --> 20:42.658
The darkness is his hunting ground.

20:42.741 --> 20:44.785
He can manage just fine without our help.

20:46.119 --> 20:49.748
You've got total faith
in your master? Awesome.

20:50.749 --> 20:54.962
Well, if Yuru hadn't caught
you, we would've done it.

20:55.045 --> 20:57.172
We can follow your scent in the dark.

20:57.798 --> 20:59.132
I see.

20:59.216 --> 21:05.347
Growing up on the mountain made
your senses keener than ours.

21:05.430 --> 21:06.932
You said you're a Kagemori.

21:07.641 --> 21:10.894
Did your clan attack Higashi Village?

21:15.941 --> 21:17.693
I was responsible for the attack.

21:19.486 --> 21:20.487
Jin-san.

21:38.130 --> 21:40.382
You've got one of those little
smoke signals, right?

21:42.342 --> 21:44.845
It lets you talk to people far away.

21:44.928 --> 21:46.555
You were using it earlier.

21:47.055 --> 21:48.890
Oh, my smartphone?

21:49.766 --> 21:51.852
Tell Asa to come here.

21:53.061 --> 21:54.855
I want to talk to her.

23:27.614 --> 23:28.907
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

23:28.990 --> 23:31.243
Gabby-chan, Gabby-chan, Gabby-chan!

23:31.827 --> 23:33.745
Jin-san's bringing my brother here.

23:34.538 --> 23:39.417
On the plane to Okinawa,
our parents vanished.
